      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Inbox Agent\n**Mode: label-only** (nothing is moved yet)\n\n1. Create Gmail labels: Te betalen, Reclame, Te checken, AI-Spam\n2. Select credentials on every orange node\n3. Test with Execute workflow, then Publish/Activate\n\nSettings: sub-workflow **Classify email**, node **Parse AI result** (CONFIG + LABELS)",
